@startuml
title Phase 2 模块依赖与插件装配
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
top to bottom direction
package "启动与宿主" as Host {
  [main / 默认装配] as Main
  [PluginLoader\n配置 / 动态导入] as Loader
  [PluginHost\n暂存 / 校验 / 提交] as Activation
}
package "CLI 内核" as Core {
  [cli\n分词 / 命令分派 / 树渲染] as CLI
  [application\n会话 / 保存点] as App
  [commands\n编辑事务 / 快照历史] as Cmd
  [io\nSVG / 文件端口] as IO
  [model\n图形 / 文档 / 图形注册] as Model
  [extensions\n四类扩展接口 / 上下文 / 注册表] as API
}
package "插件包" as Plugins {
  [builtin-shapes / builtin-commands]
  [stats / dir]
  [box / tree-star]
  [diamond（选做）]
}
Main --> Loader
Main --> Activation
Main --> Plugins : 代码装配选择
Loader --> Activation : 配置装配共用注册路径
Activation --> API
Activation --> CLI
CLI --> API
App --> Cmd
App --> IO
App --> Model
IO --> Model
Cmd --> Model
Cmd --> API
Model --> API : 提供器契约
API --> Model : 公开领域类型
API --> Cmd : 编辑事务契约
API --> CLI : 公开 Token 类型
Plugins --> API
Plugins --> Model
Plugins --> Cmd : 内置编辑命令
note bottom of Plugins
  每个实现独立注册；新增可选插件不修改内核和既有插件。
  dir 的 NodeDirectoryAccess 适配文件系统，
  其余插件通过公开领域能力和上下文工作。
end note
note bottom of Core
  内核不导入宿主或插件。
  图中包含类型依赖；实际模块导入明细见 metrics.json。
end note
@enduml
